{"sourceUrl":"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/2026/0911/c888a443829/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:56.198978+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/2026/0911/c888a443829/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>一、学院简介</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>林学与风景园林学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>原林学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span><span><span><span>华南农业大学</span></span></span><span><span>历史最悠久、底蕴最深厚的学院之一。学院设有林学博士后流动站，拥有林学一级学科博士学位授权点和风景园林专业博士学位授权点。设有林学学术硕士学位授权点，以及林业、风景园林</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个专业硕士学位授权点。林学学科为国家林业局重点学科，林学、风景园林和园林</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个专业为国家一流本科专业建设点。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院现开展接收推免生报名工作，欢迎广大推免生报名！</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>二、</span></span></span><span><span>接收推荐免试专业</span></span></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>报考专业</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>报考代码</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>拟招推免人数</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>林学（学术型）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>090700</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>林业（专业型）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>095400</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>风景园林（专业型）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086200</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span><span><span>注意：最终招生专业以研招网“推免服务系统”公布为准</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、</span></span></span><span><span>申请及资格审核</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>为方便考生报名，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年学校启用“华南农业大学硕士（推荐免试）研究生招生预报名系统”，教育部推免服务系统开通前，申请免试攻读我校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年全日制研究生的考生，可于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日前登陆</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>https://yjsglxt.scau.edu.cn/Open/RecruitTkssTmYbm/Signin.aspx</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，点击</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>，进入</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>华南农业大学硕士（推荐免试）研究生招生预报名系统</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>，进行预报名。考生端操作手册详见附件</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span><span>并扫码进入微信群，便于后续复试通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/c7/df/758db5b643628b1c280a6d93de80/0960e969-b785-47e8-9abb-6306182f51aa.jpg\" title=\"\"/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>考生须将以下材料，提交至学院联系人电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>lfzs_scau@163.com</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）第二代居民身份证及学生证复印件；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）加盖学校教务处公章的本科成绩单</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>份；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）国家英语四、六级证书或成绩单、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>或</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>GRE</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）其他证明申请人学术水平和业务能力的学术论文或获奖证书等材料复印件。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>四、</span></span></span><span><span>推免生奖学金激励制度</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>根据《华南农业大学研究生国家奖助学金实施办法》，硕士生新生中的推免生在第一学年享受一等奖学金（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10000</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>元</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>生）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院增加以下鼓励措施：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>本校推免生攻读我院各专业研究生的，在学生自愿的前提下，提前跨级跟随所在专业研究生一年级修读相关专业课程，并按学校有关规定计算为研究生阶段学分。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>推免生就读研究生期间，有优先报名成为学院助教、助管的资格。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学院优先推荐推免生（就读研究生期间）参与各项学术交流活动。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>五、</span></span></span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span><span>叶</span></span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/2026/0911/c888a443829/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>020-</span></span><span><span><span>38207232</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>lfzs_scau@163.com</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>通讯地址：广东省广州市天河区五山路</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>483</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>号华南农业大学</span></span><span><span><span>林学与风景园林学院</span></span></span><span><span>（邮编：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>510642</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>林学与风景园林学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>11</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/c7/df/758db5b643628b1c280a6d93de80/c8bbc3d6-20aa-42f8-9a39-3b18ebf4bb5f.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件1考生端操作手册.pdf\">附件1考生端操作手册.pdf</a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"35c0236c350cba581a4ad1c0e0d74a48570033b128a2b289105cc0fd22cba037","textLength":1030,"sourceSha256":"6ddc8ca0f6f116ee883ee6cf9c69f8b60bb3325e729675f0173879c067a76f15","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6ea3fb2df56c062964ea","title":"2026年华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院关于接收2027年推荐免试研究生预通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:56.198978+00:00"}
